le ordering comment, a dead timestamp field, a wrong test comment and menu ARIA structure; all fixed in this head and confirmed approvable on re-review. Rests-On #15915 in the commit; original a3f62a52 and hugh's asks #8600 and #10248 cited in the review request. Co-signed artifacts at internal/service/uidist and internal/service follow. Merge note: shares ui and internal/service paths with #15916 (03544392) and #15917 (2a273cf8); whichever lands second rebuilds the embed.","body":{"branch":"request/ui-notification-dropdown-current","commit":"0da3b399faf37f3e0d845e3a0da2d1fa3987025b","path":"ui"}}